            ["The green arrow marks the items of your Best in Slot list (sort by For you to see the best first)."] = "綠色箭頭標示你 BiS 清單中的物品（依「適合你」排序可先看到最佳的）。",
            ["The green arrow marks the items of your Best in Slot list, with the damage they add (sort by For you to see the biggest first)."] = "綠色箭頭標示你 BiS 清單中的物品及其增加的傷害（依「適合你」排序可先看到最大的）。",
            ["The items you starred, grouped by where they drop. You get an alert as soon as one drops."] = "你加星號的物品，依掉落位置分組。只要有一件掉落就會提醒你。",
            ["The items you starred; the stars, the tooltip mark and the alert when one drops."] = "你加星號的物品；星號、提示標記與掉落時的提醒。",
            ["The language is under Language; this tour starts again from Tour & help or with /lf tour. Found a bug or have an idea? Website & Discord are here and behind the ? at the top. Have fun!"] = "語言在「語言」中；可從「導覽與說明」或用 /lf tour 重新開始此導覽。發現 Bug 或有建議？網站與 Discord 在這裡，也在上方的 ? 中。祝你玩得愉快！",
            ["The language of the interface and of the game's names in Lootified."] = "Lootified 中介面與遊戲名稱的語言。",
            ["The last collect was cut off: what it had read is kept. /lf collect again reads the rest."] = "上次收集被中斷：已讀取的部分會保留。再次執行 /lf collect 會讀取其餘部分。",
            ["The level of the target dummy. It stands still, never hits back and is hit from behind."] = "訓練假人的等級。它站著不動、不會反擊，並從背後被攻擊。",
            ["The lines Lootified adds to item tooltips, one switch each. The preview shows a real tooltip as you set it."] = "Lootified 加在物品滑鼠提示中的資訊行，每行各有開關。預覽會依你的設定顯示實際的滑鼠提示。",
            ["The list of the first start: every armor your class wears, quests, dungeons and rares, drops of 10 % or more."] = "首次啟動時的清單：你職業可穿的所有護甲、任務、地城與稀有怪、機率 10 % 以上的掉落。",
            ["The loot of the dungeons' and raids' bosses and trash."] = "地城與團隊副本中首領與小怪的掉落。",
            ["The loot of the open world's rares and other mobs that carry the item."] = "野外稀有怪以及其他帶有該物品的怪物的掉落。",
            ["The picked item: its stats and where it drops (click a mob or a quest to open it)."] = "所選物品：其屬性與掉落位置（點擊怪物或任務即可開啟）。",
            ["The picked item: its stats, where it drops (click a mob or a quest to open it) and the wishlist button. You get an alert when a wishlist item drops."] = "所選物品：其屬性、掉落位置（點擊怪物或任務即可開啟）與願望清單按鈕。願望清單物品掉落時會提醒你。",
            ["The quests that give the item or need it."] = "給予或需要此物品的任務。",
            ["The rares and mobs of every zone with their drops and camps."] = "每個地區的稀有怪與怪物，以及其掉落與營地。",
            ["The rares and other mobs of every zone with their drops, drop chances and camps on the map. The page shows the zone you are in."] = "每個地區的稀有怪與其他怪物，以及其掉落、掉落機率與地圖上的營地。頁面會顯示你所在的地區。",
            ["The same for bosses and rares, for quests (with their chains) and for dungeons, raids and zones. Links between the pages open the right entry."] = "首領與稀有怪、任務（含任務鏈）以及地城、團隊副本與地區也是一樣。頁面之間的連結會開啟對應的項目。",
            ["The set fights in the simulator's planner for its exact damage: the number on the sheet is an estimate from each item simmed alone."] = "套裝會在模擬器的規劃器中戰鬥以求得精確傷害：表上的數字是將每件物品單獨模擬所得的估計值。",
            ["The simulator could not read your character: %s"] = "模擬器無法讀取你的角色：%s",
            ["The simulator fights with your talents and gear and shows every upgrade in DPS. You run the sims yourself (the Best in Slot sim takes a few minutes): pick it only if you want that."] = "模擬器以你的天賦與裝備戰鬥，並以 DPS 顯示每件物品的提升。你需要自己執行模擬（BiS 模擬需要幾分鐘）：只有需要時才選這個。",
            ["The simulator has no numbers for this item."] = "模擬器沒有此物品的數值。",
            ["The simulator is calculating"] = "模擬器正在計算",
            ["The simulator rates your damage. Your upgrades follow your stat weights."] = "模擬器評估你的傷害。你的提升依你的屬性權重計算。",
            ["The simulator stopped: %s"] = "模擬器已停止：%s",
            ["The target: %s"] = "目標：%s",
            ["The tour stopped because of combat. /lf tour starts it again."] = "導覽因戰鬥而停止。/lf tour 可重新開始。",
            ["These are the bosses, numbered in their order. Click one to see its loot next to the map; click it again to close it."] = "這些是首領，依順序編號。點擊一個即可在地圖旁查看其掉落；再點一次即可關閉。",
            ["This decides how this character's upgrades show in tooltips, loot rolls, For you and its Best in Slot list."] = "決定此角色的提升如何顯示在滑鼠提示、拾取擲骰、適合你以及其 BiS 清單中。",
            ["This dungeon has more than one floor: switch between them here. Next to the buttons is the name of the floor you see."] = "此地城有多個樓層：在這裡切換。按鈕旁顯示目前所看樓層的名稱。",
            ["This is For you, your start page: the dungeons for your level with your upgrades and your next Best in Slot items. Click anything to open it."] = "這是「適合你」，你的起始頁面：適合你等級的地城，以及你的提升與下一批 BiS 物品。點擊任何項目即可開啟。",
            ["This is For you, your start page: the dungeons for your level. Click anything to open it."] = "這是「適合你」，你的起始頁面：適合你等級的地城。點擊任何項目即可開啟。",
            ["This item is not in the loot data. It may be crafted, sold by a vendor or come from a source that is new in Forever."] = "此物品不在掉落資料中。可能是製造的、由商人販售，或來自 Forever 新增的來源。",
            ["This item is not in your game client yet (datamined / upcoming)."] = "此物品尚未在你的遊戲用戶端中（資料挖掘 / 即將推出）。",
            ["This spec fights in Bear Form, which druids learn at level 10. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此專精以熊形態戰鬥，德魯伊在 10 級學會。在那之前，請在 BiS 表上選擇其他專精。",
            ["This spec fights in Cat Form, which druids learn at level 20. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此專精以獵豹形態戰鬥，德魯伊在 20 級學會。在那之前，請在 BiS 表上選擇其他專精。",
            ["This spec fights in Defensive Stance, which warriors learn at level 10. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此專精以防禦姿態戰鬥，戰士在 10 級學會。在那之前，請在 BiS 表上選擇其他專精。",
            ["This spec fights with a pet, which hunters get at level 10. Until then, pick another spec on the Best in Slot sheet."] = "此專精與寵物一起戰鬥，獵人在 10 級取得寵物。在那之前，請在 BiS 表上選擇其他專精。",
            ["This spec tanks with a shield: put one on, then try again."] = "此專精以盾牌坦怪：請裝備盾牌後再試一次。",
            ["This tour shows every part of Lootified. At the end you see the settings, where you can switch off what you do not need."] = "此導覽介紹 Lootified 的每個部分。最後你會看到設定，可在那裡關閉不需要的功能。",
