            ["What your Best in Slot list may use"] = "你的 BiS 清單可採用的內容",
            ["What your list may use: the armor kinds (cloaks always count) and where its items may come from. The drop chance leaves out rarer drops (10 % at the start). Every change counts at once, for the sims too; Back to realistic gives back the list of your first start."] = "你的清單可採用的內容：護甲類型（披風一律計入）以及物品可來自何處。掉落機率會排除較稀有的掉落（起始為 10 %）。每項變更立即生效，模擬也一樣；「回到實際」會恢復首次啟動時的清單。",
            ["What your list may use: where its items may come from. The drop chance leaves out rarer drops (10 % at the start). Every change counts at once, for the sims too; Back to realistic gives back the list of your first start."] = "你的清單可採用的內容：物品可來自何處。掉落機率會排除較稀有的掉落（起始為 10 %）。每項變更立即生效，模擬也一樣；「回到實際」會恢復首次啟動時的清單。",
