            ["Your Best in Slot items are already owned or on your wishlist."] = "你的 BiS 物品都已擁有或已在願望清單中。",
            ["Your Best in Slot list is only an estimate so far. The sim tests every item you can wear on your character (a few minutes), then your next upgrades show here."] = "你的 BiS 清單目前只是估計。模擬會在你的角色上測試所有能穿戴的物品（需要幾分鐘），之後你的下一批提升會顯示在這裡。",
            ["Your Best in Slot list on your character, from the stat weights of your spec. An item's tooltip says where it drops."] = "依你專精的屬性權重，在你的角色上顯示 BiS 清單。物品的滑鼠提示會說明掉落位置。",
            ["Your Best in Slot list on your character: the Best in Slot sim builds it from every item you can wear. An item's tooltip says where it drops."] = "在你的角色上顯示 BiS 清單：BiS 模擬會從你能穿戴的所有物品建立清單。物品的滑鼠提示會說明掉落位置。",
