            ["Your character as the simulator reads it: gear, stats, spells, talents and pet. Press Ctrl+C to copy it, then paste it into Lootified's web simulator."] = "模擬器讀取到的你的角色：裝備、屬性、法術、天賦與寵物。按 Ctrl+C 複製，然後貼到 Lootified 的網頁模擬器。",
            ["Your character as you wear it: your damage per second, the damage of every ability, what one more point of each stat is worth and what the sim read from you and the target."] = "你目前穿戴的角色：每秒傷害、每個技能的傷害、每項屬性多 1 點的價值，以及模擬從你與目標讀取到的數值。",
            ["Your character cannot wear this item."] = "你的角色無法穿戴此物品。",
            ["Your character's damage, your own sets in the planner and the sets side by side."] = "你角色的傷害、規劃器中的自訂套裝，以及套裝並列比較。",
            ["Your class cannot use it"] = "你的職業無法使用",
