            ["Your last sim, with other gear, talents, level or fight settings: press Sim for new numbers."] = "你上次的模擬使用的是不同的裝備、天賦、等級或戰鬥設定：按下模擬取得新數值。",
            ["Your level, talents or gear changed since the last sim: sim again for a list that fits."] = "自上次模擬後，你的等級、天賦或裝備已變更：請重新模擬以取得合適的清單。",
            ["Your level, talents, gear or list changed since the last sim: sim again for a list that fits."] = "自上次模擬後，你的等級、天賦、裝備或清單已變更：請重新模擬以取得合適的清單。",
            ["Your list takes armor of this kind from head to feet; cloaks always count."] = "你的清單從頭到腳採用此類護甲；披風一律計入。",
            ["Your list was simmed with your level, talents and the gear you wear: no new sim needed. A click sims it again all the same."] = "你的清單已依你的等級、天賦與身上裝備模擬過：不需要重新模擬。點擊仍會再模擬一次。",
            ["Your name and realm are not in it. Export again after you change your gear or talents."] = "其中不含你的名稱與伺服器。變更裝備或天賦後請重新匯出。",
